"Engine: auto (Real-ESRGAN if installed, otherwise Lanczos3), realesrgan "
"(fails if missing) or lanczos"
msgstr ""
"Motor: auto (Real-ESRGAN hvis installert, ellers Lanczos3), realesrgan "
"(feiler hvis den mangler) eller lanczos"

